WEBVTT

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.480
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:12.240
So far on Aikatsu Stars!

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:17.660
I'm a second-year exchange student at the idol middle school, Venus Ark.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:19.950
I work my hardest at Aikatsu every day!

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:25.120
After bathing in the radiance of Elza-san's Star Premium Rare Coord,

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:29.500
Rola and I once again learned the value of dresses.

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:36.180
In order to learn even more about dresses, we came to Venus Ark.

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:40.060
Nijino Yume—ready for another day of Aikatsu!

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.110
This is Elza-sama's Star Premium Rare Coord.

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:55.910
Her brand, Perfect Queen, is highly regarded by celebrities across the globe.

00:00:55.910 --> 00:01:00.410
True, it does have an air befitting the name of queen.

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:04.160
This one is Lily-senpai's from Gothic Victoria.

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:09.170
It's graced with a dignified medieval flair and accented with blue roses.

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:12.920
Finally, we have Kirara-chan and FuwaFuwa Dream.

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:18.300
It definitely feels like each brand's subtleties enhance the idol's charms.

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:19.640
Right.

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:25.640
An idol and her dress can raise each other's appeal tens and hundreds of times higher than they are alone. {I know but}

00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:28.480
I asked the right person, Koharu. You're full of knowledge.

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:31.230
I'm just passing on what Elza-sama taught me.

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:34.030
Still, I'm seeing things in a new light.

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:34.940
What?

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:37.450
I love Spice Chord.

00:01:38.070 --> 00:01:40.280
I always have, and I always will.

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:43.910
It's just...

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:47.670
I have no interest in those without even a brand to their name.

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:48.880
Stand down.

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:53.460
What is it?

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:56.880
Oh, it's nothing. Anyway...

00:01:56.880 --> 00:02:01.720
Could you keep the fact that we've been researching dresses together a secret from Yume and them?

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:03.390
Huh? But why?

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:07.890
Well, you know... it's kind of embarrassing.

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:10.310
It's an emergency!

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:11.650
Wait, what?

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:15.070
What are you two doing?

00:02:15.070 --> 00:02:17.070
N-Nothing, really.

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:18.910
Just taking a nap.

00:02:18.910 --> 00:02:21.030
This isn't the time for that!

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:22.580
It's Tsubasa-senpai!

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:04.390
I, Kisaragi Tsubasa,

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:13.140
will be leaving Four Star Academy to study abroad in Los Angeles for a venture into Hollywood.

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:18.770
What will happen to the position of 
Spice Chord's muse that you are vacating?

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:22.780
We are working to find a successor as quickly as possible.

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:28.740
That's more than enough.

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:29.540
Understood.

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:33.540
You're not going to make a move, Elza?

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:38.540
Like having one of our students be the muse like with FuwaFuwa Dream?

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:43.590
That too would be interesting, 
but it appears she has her own ideas.

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:46.470
I lose nothing by waiting to see her plans through.

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:53.680
Today's course is chicken acquired from Nagoya City sautéed in fresh herbs.

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:56.850
Commoners have a habit of calling cowards "chicken".

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:03.490
I can only hope the inheritor of Spice Chord is not one herself.

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:07.870
Tsubasa-senpai's going abroad too?

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:15.120
First Onee-chan and Hime-senpai, and now Tsubasa-senpai has left to travel the world.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:17.540
What'll happen to Spice Chord?

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:24.380
Tsubasa-senpai?!

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:34.060
I'll have to say my farewells to you as well.

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:37.350
Hoo-chan, take good care of your family.

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:39.730
Tsubasa-senpai!

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:42.650
I came as fast as I could.

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:46.360
Sorry for calling you out of the blue.

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:48.990
Um, we tagged along with her.

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:52.620
That's no problem. I wasn't intending for this to be a secret conversation.

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:59.750
U-Um... Tsubasa-senpai, I'm happy to see you again.

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:02.340
Nanakura! It's been a while.

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:03.920
Yozora really wanted to see you too.

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:05.260
O-Oh!

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:09.890
Word's that you've started designing too. I'm looking forward to your creations.

00:06:09.890 --> 00:06:11.510
Thank you!

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:15.060
So, Tsubasa-senpai, what did you want to talk about?

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:16.390
Ah, right.

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:19.440
Sakuraba.

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:24.190
I want you to succeed me in Spice Chord.

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:27.570
That's awesome, Rola! You made it!

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:30.070
W-Wait, are you sure about this?

00:06:30.070 --> 00:06:35.490
Well, I feel a little bad bringing it up after I made you the offer, but it comes with a condition.

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:38.080
A condition?

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:42.460
And so,

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:49.220
you are to take a test to determine whether you are worthy of inheriting Spice Chord tomorrow?

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:50.260
Yes.

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:54.430
What are your personal feelings on the matter?

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:58.060
It's true that I love Spice Chord.

00:06:58.060 --> 00:07:01.560
I just don't know if I deserve this.

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:05.690
You've had experience wearing 
Spice Chord before, isn't that right?

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:08.070
If you know anything that might be able to help—

00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:09.110
I do not.

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:14.080
Though if I had to say...

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:21.790
The commonality of those who are successful is the ability to do what is required. {I forgot to mention this is also a made up quote in the first round}

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:24.750
Those were the words of an expert economist.

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:28.300
Do what is required...

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:29.420
Put simply,

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:34.600
it means to do what must be done.

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:40.310
What must be done...

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:48.610
Wow, it's so cute! That's called Spice Chord!

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:52.240
Hey, lookie! Doesn't this look like Spice Chord?

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:57.120
My favorite brand is Spice Chord.

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:21.680
Okay!

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:27.310
Now then, it's time for your test.

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:30.150
The witnesses will be myself, Yachigusa Momoko, and...

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:35.360
This is Hibiki Anna! We're ready for you to get it on.

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:37.370
Thank you for your time.

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:38.620
Do your best!

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:40.540
Rola will pass for sure.

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:41.620
Yeah!

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:45.670
There will be three tests. I'll give you the results at the very end.

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:47.130
I understand.

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:52.380
Spice Chord is a cool brand built upon striking people with its stunning rock inspiration.

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:57.340
Its bearers must be able to maintain their composure at all times.

00:08:57.340 --> 00:08:58.600
And so!

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:02.480
It's Test of Bravery Time! {courage does fit, but is already taken}

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:09.820
Th-That's...

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:34.630
You're going to bungee jump from the top.

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:37.720
However, you must maintain your composure.

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:42.390
Will she be okay? I thought Rola was afraid of heights.

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:44.310
Don't worry, Koharu-chan.

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:45.480
Huh?

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:51.900
<i>Do what must be done.</i>

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:56.320
<i>Right now, what I must do is...</i>

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:10.630
Going my way!

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:12.040
Wow, Rola...

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:14.550
Rola's totally conquered her fear!

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:15.920
That's great!

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:17.510
Nevertheless...

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:22.760
To have the level of control required to strike a pose is admirable.

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:26.020
Looks like she'll unquestionably pass the first test.

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:28.390
Moving on to the second test...

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:30.650
Coordinate Time!

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:32.150
Hi there!

00:10:32.150 --> 00:10:33.070
Yuri-senpai?

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:35.400
Please direct your attention to the monitor!

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:42.160
If you want to succeed a brand, 
naturally you'll need a good fashion sense.

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:48.410
You'll be played a series of song intros 
and asked to pick a matching dress for each.

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:51.670
An intro quiz on top of testing her sense for coordination.

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:53.090
Good luck, Rola!

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:58.170
<i>My knowledge of dresses may still leave something to be desired,</i>

00:10:58.170 --> 00:11:01.430
<i>but all I can do now is what must be done!</i>

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:05.180
Let's get right into question one! Music start!

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:12.060
Number three: Purple London Check Coord!

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:13.110
So fast!

00:11:13.110 --> 00:11:14.610
Nice one, Rola!

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:16.820
Congratulations!

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:21.700
You did well to match up a coord with 1, 2, Sing for You!

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:19.450
I wasn't expecting any hiccups.

00:11:19.450 --> 00:11:25.580
However, there's a factor more important than fitness or knowledge that is needed to inherit Spice Chord.

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:25.580
But it's only going to get harder from here on out.

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:31.080
There's no time to waste, on to the next! Music Start!

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:30.290
I'm certain that the true purpose of these tests is for Kisaragi to ascertain that.

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:37.710
Number eight: Girls Flag Coord!

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:42.260
Congratulations! You got a perfect score!

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:43.340
Yes!

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:44.140
Yay!

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:45.850
Awesome, Rola!

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:48.390
It was worth all that studying, Rola.

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:49.480
I'm impressed.

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:49.480
Studying?

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:51.640
Yuri-senpai, thank you so much.

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:51.640
J-Just talking to myself!

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:52.810
Good luck on the next one.

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:53.600
Okay!

00:11:57.650 --> 00:11:59.610
We're finally at the last test. {am I baka}

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:00.860
Right.

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:03.240
This is the department store's roof, isn't it?

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:05.490
What could the test be?

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:08.290
The last test is this!

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:12.080
Taiyaki?!

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:13.620
Exactly right.

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:18.880
Sakuraba will have to pass out this pile of taiyaki within the next hour.

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:20.090
There's so much...

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:22.260
And in just one hour?

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:27.220
B-But everyone around here knows who Rola is, 
so I'm sure she'll have no trouble.

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:28.140
I think not.

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:30.890
See for yourself.

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:33.980
This is a department store rooftop on a weekday.

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:39.020
Moreover, the surrounding 
shopping arcade was deserted as well.

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:44.030
<i>And that is exactly as it should be, for in a nearby park...</i>

00:12:44.030 --> 00:12:48.280
Everyone, thanks so much for coming!

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:53.120
Today we're having a special autograph and handshake session!

00:12:55.420 --> 00:13:00.210
Um, this event was constructed rather suddenly—
was there a particular reason behind it?

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:04.880
I'm not really sure, but it was Tsubasacchi's request, and I wasn't just gonna refuse.

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:10.930
A-As for me, I greatly respect her as my Theater Class predecessor, but that doesn't explain the abruptness...

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:14.100
Come on, Ako-chan! All our fans are waiting!

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:15.640
Coming!

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:19.610
Everyone, are you watching Idol Mermaid?

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:21.860
Yeah!

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:30.330
With the town so empty, how will she pass out all that taiyaki?

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:32.910
We'll just have to lend her a hand!

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:35.040
But that would disqualify her.

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:37.250
There is no need to be concerned.

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:42.420
Rola-san should now be able to determine what is required of her.

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:43.920
That gets me going!

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:46.340
Rola?!

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:53.100
Rola?!

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:55.850
Felicitai-tai! Felicitai-tai!

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:57.850
Felicitai-tai, I say! Felicitai-tai!

00:13:57.850 --> 00:14:01.190
Felicitai-tai! Felicitai-tai!

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:03.110
Wasn't that Rola-chan? {who else would run around like a maniac in a fish suit?}{there was that girl from denpa onna}{you correct mother fucker}

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:04.530
It was!

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:06.240
I heard she's giving out taiyaki.

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:07.990
What, seriously?

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:08.950
Let's check it out.

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:10.070
It's Rola-chan!

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:11.580
So cute!

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:16.790
<i>If nobody's there, I just need to bring them!</i>

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:19.580
Huh?

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:21.380
Is our crowd thinning?

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:26.760
<i>Sparkle Lamé Coord.</i>

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:31.890
<i>The rock inspiration and bold form make never-before-seen chemistry. {is she high? also compare to lyrics}{}{there we go}</i>

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:36.390
<i>I'll be okay. They won't let me down.</i>

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:40.520
<i>I'll believe in the Spice Chord that's always supported me.</i>

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:45.440
Sakuraba Rola—it's my time to shine!

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:41.990
Look at this audience.

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:43.910
Where did they all come from?

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:46.920
Everything was due to Rola-san's power.

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:49.710
You were able to do what must be done.

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:57.470
Looks like you handed them all out.

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:58.680
Yes.

00:17:58.680 --> 00:18:01.680
I have faith that you'll be fine.

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:05.430
The chord of Spice Chord comes from a guitar chord.

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:10.690
A striking chord that can shake the soul—that is Spice Chord.

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:13.940
You are not simply inheriting the brand's name.

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:18.820
More valuable is the impassioned soul of someone who loves the brand.

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:27.830
You've come a long way since you were a worrying first-year.

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:34.840
Sakuraba.

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:37.670
Kisaragi is waiting for you.

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:48.100
Tsubasa-senpai.

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:50.230
Sakuraba.

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:54.860
Well done. That was a wonderful performance.

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:56.360
Thank you.

00:18:57.190 --> 00:19:00.740
Before I tell you the results, there's a question I'd like you to answer.

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:08.040
Spice Chord boasts one of the longest histories of all the many brands out there.

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:11.290
Faced with the weight of this history,

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:13.840
do you believe you can bear it?

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:19.970
Honestly, I'm not sure.

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:21.640
Still!

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:26.010
I will do everything I possibly can!

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:28.520
Even if you were to fail my test?

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:31.270
Yes. Nothing will change.

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:34.270
I will continue to sing alongside Spice Chord!

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:42.280
You pass.

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:45.910
That was the true final exam.

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:47.450
The true...

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:55.710
You resolutely faced each test and searched for the answers from within your very soul.

00:19:55.710 --> 00:20:00.510
It was only possible due to the passionate soul you've cultivated.

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:09.350
You have the right to inherit Spice Chord, along with the passionate soul to match.

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:11.690
Gift Time.

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:16.480
What's...

00:20:16.480 --> 00:20:20.990
Just a little present for the successor of Spice Chord.

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:25.740
A Spice Bear!

00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:29.740
Anna-sensei and I both gave our love to Spice Chord.

00:20:29.740 --> 00:20:34.170
Now it's your turn to advance it as you see fit.

00:20:37.210 --> 00:20:38.170
Okay!

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:40.840
Rola!

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:44.050
You did it, Rola!

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:45.510
H-Hey, Yume!

00:20:46.430 --> 00:20:47.850
Congrats, Rola!

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:51.140
I think you're perfect to take on Spice Chord.

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:54.690
Thanks. I'll make it into a brand that's undeniably mine!

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:57.190
And come on, stop hanging off me, Yume.

00:20:57.190 --> 00:20:58.150
Just let me!

00:20:58.150 --> 00:21:00.070
Yume-chan is so cute.

00:20:58.610 --> 00:21:00.690
Fine, want a sour konbu?

00:21:00.690 --> 00:21:02.990
It's sour, but I'll have one.

00:21:02.990 --> 00:21:04.360
Wait, that konbu...

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:08.240
With this, you'll be able to take off without any lingering regrets.

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:13.000
Yes.

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:28.680
Take care!

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:35.190
I, Saotome Ako, as someone who has received all of Tsubasa-senpai's theater teachings,

00:21:35.190 --> 00:21:39.690
vow to pass your skills on to the next generation!

00:21:43.320 --> 00:21:48.070
Yes, Kisaragi Tsubasa has departed for Los Angeles.

00:21:48.070 --> 00:21:50.950
She has passed the mantle of Spice Chord to...

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:52.950
Sakuraba Rola.

00:21:57.830 --> 00:21:59.960
This was the ideal conclusion.

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:01.750
Why's that?

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:06.930
All three Venus Ark exchange students now have their own brands.

00:22:06.930 --> 00:22:09.430
I see. That <i>is</i> intriguing.

00:22:09.430 --> 00:22:11.970
Huh? What do you mean?

00:22:11.970 --> 00:22:13.930
You'll see in due time.

00:23:55.830 --> 00:23:59.160
Your performance was so passionate and great.

